### Design direction

Use a sophisticated, restrained GovTech enterprise aesthetic: modern, precise, trustworthy, evidence-driven, and highly readable.

Suggested palette:

- Deep midnight navy: #101B2D
- Primary teal: #0F766E
- Bright teal accent: #14B8A6
- Cool off-white background: #F6F8FB
- White surfaces: #FFFFFF
- Primary text: #172033
- Secondary text: #64748B
- Subtle borders: #E2E8F0
